 "title": "A Coin's Political Delay",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "🪙",
 "sentences": [
  "A coin changed because of an election.",
  "The 1921 Alabama Centennial half dollar was a belated anniversary celebration.",
  "Laura Gardin Fraser designed it, becoming the first woman to design a coin.",
  "Congress originally planned for commemorative quarters, but changed them to halves.",
  "Production stalled because sponsors waited to see if President Wilson would lose.",
  "They ultimately replaced his portrait with Alabama's first and current governors."
